    "body": "## Commits\r\n- e41543c38 Achievements: Cache latest/nearest achievement info\r\n- a0aac8ef1 dep/rcheevos: Bump to latest upstream\r\n- 1bb1354d4 Achievements: Use rc_client as source of truth for HC mode\r\n- d286b96c2 Achievements: Swap RAInterface for RAIntegration via rc_client\r\n- 15a81e554 Deps: Remove RAInterface\r\n- 21560537c Achievements: Fix crash starting with no game\r\n- 4708a8fda Achievements: Fix login while ingame\r\n- 6165b504b Achievements: Use new badge_url/badge_locked_url fields\r\n- 8e73b1db7 Achievements: Display notification on subset complete\r\n- 284b13cd4 Achievements: Fix starting with RAIntegration-forced HC mode\r\n- e7a346559 Achievements: Display hardcore disabled subtitle in game summary\r\n- 2eecf6b79 GPU/HW: Clear depth at vblank time in 480i games\r\n- 12a50fe7c GameDB: exclude analog support for some 2D games (#3402)\r\n- 3b5d2e96f GameDB: PGXP-CPU for Spider-Man games\r\n- 5f48adb53 RegTest: Compile fix\r\n- f0d4816de RegTest: Add function queueing for RunOnCPUThread()\r\n- c1e01af51 Host: Expose RunOnUIThread() to core\r\n- 78ff3b97b dep/rcheevos: Make RAIntegration loadable in two parts\r\n- fca250257 Achievements: Initialize RAIntegration in two parts\r\n- c192bd798 Bus: Stub out 0x1F802080\r\n- 9573286e3 FullscreenUI: Increase notification rounding\r\n- faa7ca512 FullscreenUI: Add confirmation to hardcore mode enable/reset\r\n- 8f8f7cd1c Achievements: Queue RAIntegration writes on CPU thread\r\n- 057398b4a FullscreenUI: Mostly replace C string usage with string_view\r\n- 32963c3f6 Controller: Use string_view() for localised strings\r\n- b78d3b4b7 dep/imgui: Update to v1.91.9b\r\n- 65fd6f9ff FullscreenUI: Fix crash in hotkey settings\r\n- ca46c1182 FullscreenUI: More string_view usage\r\n- 46dd32ad4 Updated Swedish translation (#3403)\r\n- 57fc5b9d2 Update Russian translation (#3405)\r\n- 903a1570f GameDB: exclude analog support for some Rockman titles (#3404)\r\n- 03d6d12b8 Image: Export RGBA8 conversion functions\r\n- 79cb5779b Data: Swap svg classes for inline style\r\n- cf7feec9c Deps: Swap lunasvg for plutosvg\r\n- 2e6c6dffa Qt: Slightly adjust widget sizes\r\n- 89301688d Qt: Use grid layout for forms\r\n- ebf33f32f FullscreenUI: Crash fix\r\n- 1a5e852ff GameDB: disable analog support for some demos and beta versions (#3406)\r\n- 7583425c5 Atualização Português do Brasil (#3407)\r\n- 751d81eff GPU/TextureCache: Handle FetchTexture() fails\r\n- b1ce3bf0b Data: Fix link in thirdparty.html\r\n- a0de2feba GPUThread: Minor logic corrections\r\n- 4c1aba62f System: Remove unused function\r\n- 3d2085f79 GPU: Fix some CPU thread state reads\r\n- c9ae4dcd0 SPU: Enable VU meter in debug builds\r\n- 9c819d967 ImGuiManager: Fix tab key handling\r\n- ddf906f37 FullscreenUI: Polish achievements login dialog\r\n- 7aa831c8d FullscreenUI: Improve look of slider popups\r\n- 5b5eef61d FullscreenUI: Increase spacing between menu items\r\n- def6b7611 FullscreenUI: Make menu item borders optional\r\n- 9a6725367 FullscreenUI: Change default background name\r\n- 1fa77e530 FullscreenUI: Center achievement/leaderboard images\r\n- 0003cf7b1 CI/Flatpak: Bump to KDE 6.9 SDK\r\n- d840a825e CI: Use kde-6.9 flatpak docker image\r\n- 75ae7dead FullscreenUI: Add padding to game list\r\n- a86eabc1f Win32RawInputSource: Fix handling of absolute positioned devices"
