    "body": "## Commits\r\n- e5cec0563 Qt/BPM: Add Green Giant Theme (#3390)\r\n- eea415975 Updated Swedish translation (#3391)\r\n- 10fea83b4 GameDB: Intelligent Qube doesn't support analog controller (#3392)\r\n- fffa44911 Atualização Português do Brasil (#3393)\r\n- 19c03aff4 Update the Simple-Chinese translation to latest. (#3394)\r\n- 5c41a48e3 GPU/HW: Fix crash when changing downsampling factor\r\n- de6a8fba5 BIOS: Set priority of v4.1 E to 10\r\n- 346f0f945 GameDatabase: Fix incorrect multitap key parsing\r\n- 6eddc0b98 GPUDevice: Don't allow copy-resize between different formats\r\n- d176109d3 GPU/HW: Fix incorrect interlaced VRAM extract offset\r\n- 62d7a7338 GPU/HW: Add 'Scaled Interlacing' option\r\n- 74064af73 GameDB: Set disable scaled interlacing on various games\r\n- 115ba4433 CPU/Interpreter: Emulate lo/hi read stall after mult/div\r\n- f4e93df1b Update the Simple-Chinese translation to latest. (#3395)\r\n- 3ab3e4be0 ImGuiManager: Tweak OSD message rounding\r\n- 4afa41b92 Qt: Move async readahead sectors to advanced settings\r\n- 32b09193d Qt: Move force video timing to console settings\r\n- 2311c8d28 Settings: Convert dithering/true color options to a dropdown\r\n- 2d477f80b Qt: Add tooltips to setup wizard graphics settings\r\n- 741e97168 GPU/HW: Add 'True Color (Full)' dithering mode\r\n- 98d1c7198 GameDB: Force full true color for Bust a Move 2\r\n- 902095951 Qt: Add game list background function\r\n- 03d7af2ef FullscreenUI: Add border rounding to menu items\r\n- 9411e40c2 FullscreenUI: Fix assert when booting+loading state\r\n- 3ffd20b83 FullscreenUI: Display game list attributes in darker colour\r\n- 1fca8ae6b FullscreenUI: Fix start-in-game-list mode using grid\r\n- 4ce001aef GameDatabase: Add DisableFullTrueColor trait\r\n- 2cb6ce635 Mini: Fix non-first game list refresh\r\n- 104c82c2c Mini: Fix right button forwarding\r\n- 3f0abccb5 CI: Don't use zlib-ng on cross-compiled AppImages\r\n- ae9023ddf CI: Build armhf AppImages\r\n- ece18d10c PCDrv: Allow opening by absolute path\r\n- ceef7af1d GameList: Fix crash if cache fails to open\r\n- fbadacae7 CDROM: Fudge track autopause hold position\r\n- 58bd87666 Qt: Fix crash when FSUI open and game list activated\r\n- ea3774cec FullscreenUI: Fix setting BIOS to Auto Detect\r\n- f80a77fa2 FullscreenUI: Fix popup item border going outside of window\r\n- 6f2225fb6 FullscreenUI: Remove redundant ActiveButton() and friends\r\n- 003518c23 FullscreenUI: Fix nav wrapping if first item is disabled\r\n- 9ef7f54f1 FullscreenUI: Enable all windows to nav-wrap\r\n- f36062a94 FullscreenUI: Fix duplicate item in advanced settings\r\n- e4a028834 FullscreenUI: Fix keynav default in open-in-game-list mode\r\n- c7504e701 dep/fmt: Bump to v11.1.4\r\n- 576658b6e Settings: Max speedup cycles should be at least 1\r\n- 0687e59bd FullscreenUI: Rewrite popup dialog handling\r\n- ba3c69371 Qt: Fix double memcard warning on shutdown\r\n- 3cf2f4172 FullscreenUI: Fix crash changing renderer\r\n- 730fa6795 FullscreenUI: Darken titled toast text\r\n- 37230107f FullscreenUI: Run idle while notifications/toasts are onscreen\r\n- b4ae19411 Achievements: Show unconfirmed unlocks in pause menu\r\n- 54c42f9c2 Achievements: Consider all-hidden-leaderboards as no leaderboards\r\n- a3e840526 FullscreenUI: Fix multi-disc selection with duplicate filenames\r\n- 3bf5ded0d FullscreenUI: Fix various issues\r\n- 9bcd738f5 FullscreenUI: Make save state selector a main window\r\n- 2d31bf568 FullscreenUI: Convert input binding into a PopupDialog\r\n- 4e2872f24 FullscreenUI: Fix consecutive choice dialogs\r\n- e6e631321 FullscreenUI: Add offscreen-based screen fade\r\n- 64513395f FullscreenUI: Add fade transition to most screen changes\r\n- c5cc94c4b FullscreenUI: Fix hotkey categories duplicating\r\n- 04c5a9f1b FullscreenUI: Improve leaderboard text contrast\r\n- 3292833fb FullscreenUI: Add option to turn off animations\r\n- d2c09dfaf Settings: Split read and seek cycles for maximum CD speedup\r\n- 8c1f75ab8 GameDatabase: Add overrides for maximum CD speedup cycles\r\n- 162d742cc CDROM: Remove hack for Fighting Force\r\n- 049ec4af9 CI/Linux: Bump discord-rpc/lunasvg commits\r\n- b798d8f1a Settings: Add option for enabling GPU-based validation\r\n- acd684bca D3D12Device: Fix a couple of errors in ROV handling\r\n- c7139b943 GPU/HW: Remove redundant check\r\n- bbdc6ab4e Misc: Fix a bunch of code analysis warnings\r\n- ffd6726a5 Qt: Drop -settings/-portable CLI parameters\r\n- 1332f6da7 Atualização Português do Brasil (#3397)\r\n- d9363108d Updated Swedish translation (#3398)\r\n- fdfbc7f56 Spanish (Spain) translation update 2025/04/03 (#3399)\r\n- b3087657b Update the Simple-Chinese translation to latest. (#3400)\r\n- c75d5f71b CrashHandler: Include assertion/panic information in dumps\r\n- fe60a2a87 CrashHandler: Replace invalid parameter and purecall handlers\r\n- f494cb47c Qt: Widen status bar widgets\r\n- 426cdd161 Qt: Center icons in grid view\r\n- 836a0c732 Qt: Fix achievements text highlight colour\r\n- f05c627e4 Qt: Update glyph ranges\r\n- 46ae1780c Qt: Fix double-click-fullscreen with notifications up\r\n- 47e941cdc Qt: Fix shutdown from Big Picture exiting application\r\n- 64fac4c9d Qt: Fix interacting with pause menu after double-click-fullscreen\r\n- 162150c50 FullscreenUI: Force key nav on first open\r\n- 079dae37f FullscreenUI: Use transition for background/theme changes\r\n- 0f6e5bb1f FullscreenUI: Fix pause menu achievements text progress colour\r\n- 584ed4bb3 FullscreenUI: Fix progress bar line at 0%\r\n- 4ead87d19 README: Mention ARM32/ARM64 AppImage builds"
