    "body": "## Commits\r\n- c3ce0eece Atualização Português do Brasil (#3385)\r\n- 160f1ea8a Qt: Fix vibration motor binding not showing some devices\r\n- 8cfd843d8 System: Fix depth clear threshold not applying immediately\r\n- b230c9c63 CPU/PGXP: Use GTE MAX_Z for Z normalization\r\n- 78bb14bd2 CPU: Fix disassembly of GTE instructions in log\r\n- 826f10239 CPU/Recompiler: Flush GTE completion cycle on load without fastmem\r\n- 7eb7ad684 CPU/Recompiler: Remove load delay flag from lwc2\r\n- 9939f1cd0 CPU/Interpreter: Use __builtin_{add,sub}_overflow for exceptions\r\n- 95797b05f GPU: Force early run on GP0 FIFO overflow\r\n- 6437a5db6 GPU/TextureCache: Dump textures asynchronously\r\n- e73ca9e05 Qt: Fix new range for depth clear threshold\r\n- 705fe11e0 Qt: Fix incorrect file filter for memory card import\r\n- 2bfbec3e9 Settings: Use new key name for depth threshold\r\n- ee6887b68 GPU/HW: Add stat for depth buffer clears\r\n- 58dc7562a GPU/HW: Add in-pass clear depth pipeline\r\n- 29f19d0ab Spanish (Spain) translation update (#3386)\r\n- 9f0bbccd5 Achievements: Fix progress bar text alignment\r\n- e25f287d6 Qt: Avoid stuck in temporary render-to-separate mode\r\n- 8bffd9725 Qt: Lock system when automatic updater shows\r\n- c717f547c Deps: Update to SDL3 3.2.8\r\n- cd694c01d GDBServer: Improve ack handling\r\n- 2f5855a7a GDBServer: Get rid of <map> usage\r\n- 814263b44 GDBServer: Mostly rewrite handlers and fix undefined behaviour\r\n- a0c06f8d9 GDBServer: Implement 's' command (single step)\r\n- 7bae23d79 GDBServer: Implement memory breakpoints\r\n- 541af8d5d GDBServer: Stub out thread commands\r\n- 492a55ee8 FullscreenUI: Add icons to achievement list categories\r\n- d6ab840e4 FullscreenUI: Use RetroAchievements game icon as fallback game image\r\n- aeadd4c28 FullscreenUI: Move game info to top of pause menu\r\n- 72a0ba1e8 FullscreenUI: Fix pause menu light theme shadow colour\r\n- 44af55a77 FullscreenUI: Differentiate title/subtitle colours\r\n- 9a9ed52b7 Qt: Fix vertical alignment in patches page\r\n- f6296ceb0 Qt: Increase setup wizard dialog height\r\n- 4fc49ee0c FullscreenUI: Tweak the highlight background color (#3387)\r\n- ba3295930 VulkanDevice: Allow 0x0 window size\r\n- e422afdec FullscreenUI: Improve achievements pause menu overlays\r\n- 531b3e103 Update the Simple-Chinese translation to latest. (#3388)\r\n- 511663198 Qt: Update glyph ranges\r\n- c57689cc9 FullscreenUI: Inherit colour alpha for shadowed text\r\n- 9c971825a FullscreenUI: Apply theme to ingame achievement overlays\r\n- b6fa2cecd FullscreenUI: Fix shadowed text alpha again\r\n- cffafad2c ImGuiManager: Use fullscreen UI theme for OSD\r\n- f11c31b41 ImGuiOverlays: Apply theme to save state selector\r\n- 6c867859b FullscreenUI: Apply theme to loading screen\r\n- 3d0f03869 FullscreenUI: Move game list settings to main tab\r\n- 6e27b8ab9 FullscreenUI: Add option to start/open to game list\r\n- 1189f5384 FullscreenUI: Add 'Automatic' theme that syncs with Qt\r\n- db3b68916 FullscreenUI: Add Dark Ruby theme (#3389)\r\n- 4bac7cb79 FullscreenUI: Fix some dialogs not being cancellable\r\n- 2a86faa51 FullscreenUI: Replace landing icons with colourable icons\r\n- 973406651 FullscreenUI: Add StaticGray background\r\n- 0a470067f FullscreenUI: Move appearance up in settings order\r\n- c82c007a7 FullscreenUI: Add settings reset option to settings\r\n- bcd4b918d FullscreenUI: Fix black screen on renderer change\r\n- 8a0400ad2 GameList: Don't try to scan gpudump files\r\n- dd885cfe2 GameList: Cache invalid entries\r\n- 830842891 GameList: Rename max value enum for consistency\r\n- 3420af829 FullscreenUI: Display unlock rarity in achievements view\r\n- 4f00a7c7c FullscreenUI: Add rounding to achievements progress bars\r\n- 61de096d2 FullscreenUI: Add status text (left side of footer)\r\n- a1e5bb7bc FullscreenUI: Display legend for achievement status icons\r\n- 27fc7de07 FullscreenUI: Add translucency/shadow to achievement notifications\r\n- e3cb3d029 FullscreenUI: Fix system not unpausing after HC disable popup\r\n- a1d69982f CI: Update AppStream metainfo"
