    "body": "## Commits\r\n- 2011c5511 Update the Simple-Chinese translation to latest. (#3377)\r\n- b764ed468 DDGoController: Fix incorrect translation context\r\n- eda32e069 Qt: Fix image key in overlay export\r\n- fbbc4943f FullscreenUI: Fix crash in game properties on non-scanned file\r\n- 08bbb4a98 Updated Spanish (Latin America) translation (#3378)\r\n- 0b167aad5 Atualização Português do Brasil (#3379)\r\n- f7f17a077 Cheats: Add Enable8MBRAM option for patches\r\n- 498e7aac5 X11Tools: Load libxcb and friends dynamically\r\n- 0733e173b FullscreenUI: Add BackgroundProgressCallback\r\n- 4bddd38d7 WindowInfo: Add SDL window type\r\n- ee1a3b904 VulkanDevice: Support SDL window type\r\n- df9f15eb6 OpenGLDevice: Support SDL window type\r\n- 37fa0d135 Mini: Add duckstation-mini interface\r\n- 6a86c8044 CPU: Correct wording about cop2 and IRQs\r\n- ec7c83a58 Settings: Fix race toggling OSD messages\r\n- be970bcfe Qt: Handle inverted+negated axes when mapping\r\n- 89d9842c7 FullscreenUI: Fix popup title colours\r\n- ea8f3e5e5 Scripts: Support generating both Qt and Mini AppImages\r\n- 15fde6a51 CI: Add ARM64 AppImage builds\r\n- 5dc0a3630 FullscreenUI: Add Themes (#3380)\r\n- 5a4e87aba FullscreenUI: Reorder interface settings to match Qt\r\n- 9d9da94b7 FullscreenUI: Default to dark theme on unknown value\r\n- 9bfc3e90c FullscreenUI: Hook up dynamic toast colour\r\n- 34fdbafe8 FullscreenUI: Add drop shadows to most text\r\n- 965da856d FullscreenUI: Add additional rounding to some dialogs\r\n- 4bfb37f8f Qt: Add graphics and achievements to setup wizard\r\n- a0fef2d5a Qt: Merge gamelistmodel.cpp and gamelistwidget.cpp\r\n- 38146f202 FullscreenUI: Fix toast colors and add more themes (#3381)\r\n- 859f5090c FullscreenUI: Update translation strings\r\n- c775872a6 GameDB: ASCII and VIP demos don't support analog controllers. (#3384)\r\n- af4eb6806 Updated Swedish translation (#3383)\r\n- 4c64e4879 Mini: Log fatal errors to stderr\r\n- 0bf0b5c22 Qt: Fix typo in setup wizard\r\n- b8d86a18d GameDB: Kagero II & III"
