    "body": "## Commits\r\n- f4aa5e1b9 MemoryCard: Filename -> Path\r\n- 13d58d8ed Qt: Move fast boot/fast forward to console settings\r\n- e9bfca8cc System: Add 'Fast Forward Memory Card Access' option\r\n- 2bfc40824 Bus: Enable mmap fastmem on uppermost KSEG0 mirror\r\n- 2fcf115d0 GameDB: Drop LUT fastmem overrides\r\n- 7d80a74dc GameDatabase: Remove now-unused traits\r\n- 8772c336e CPU: Don't stall until GTE completion on write\r\n- 958fd0049 GPU/HW: Don't use shader for self-overlapping copies\r\n- ce8b1f099 GPU: Small optimization to lanczos shader\r\n- 456257371 Update Russian translation (#3372)\r\n- 369f62318 Cheats: Only display codes for selected revision\r\n- 1b3ca81ef Qt: Fix hotkey search placeholder localisation\r\n- b45f9c39c Atualização Português do Brasil (#3373)\r\n- cba9d0001 Qt: Further improve async cover loading\r\n- 9928d01ac Common: Fix ARM64 build on clang-cl 19\r\n- e688e24eb GTE: Use floating-point math for preserve-proj-fp\r\n- 5bd1a492b GameDatabase: Turn PGXPPreserveProjFP into a boolean setting\r\n- 4ce1b1afe GameDB: Set PGXPPreserveProjFP for Vagrant Story\r\n- cb10c6fbf Qt: Ensure build warning is themed\r\n- 0c30acb28 Qt: Work around QtWayland bugs\r\n- 9a75af2fa Qt: Explicitly set desktop file path on startup\r\n- b57049f1a CI: Enable Wayland on AppImage/Flatpak builds\r\n- 2f5c4d819 Common: Add xorshift-based PRNG class\r\n- 6f25cf31a CDROM: Add randomness to repeated seek times\r\n- 72ac4f94d CDROM: Increase delay for pause-when-paused\r\n- 31a5d8c48 GameDB: Tama - Adventurous Ball in Giddy Labyrinth hash\r\n- 78bd0fdf3 Qt: Always use ARGB32 for padded cover images\r\n- 6a0c73b54 Qt: Add AMOLED theme (#3374)\r\n- 373c83c35 GameDB: PGXP-CPU for Twisted Metal 2\r\n- d1b9473cd Deps: Update cpuinfo\r\n- f96ab3afd Deps: Switch zlib to zlib-ng\r\n- d5c83a80a GameDB: Sorcerer's Maze (#3375)\r\n- f2715b39e GameDB: Falcata - Astran Pardma no Monshou hash (#3376)\r\n- 90cb92bcc CI: Ensure libz.so.1 is packaged in AppImage\r\n- fa3815d68 Achievements: Fix progress database corruption\r\n- 91370ee5a Achievements: Update both HC and SC counts on unlock/boot\r\n- 5fea81c07 Qt: Show only HC achievement count if HC == SC\r\n- d81246364 Qt: Ensure SIGCHLD is ignored properly\r\n- 3ea26cc91 GPU: Rewrite automatic resolution scaling"
